.el .ds Aq '
.TH ifg-context 1  "ifg-context 0.9.1"
.SH NAME
ifg\-context \- Read AI\-oriented project context: summary, tree, map, symbols, code search, PR
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBifg context\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read AI\-oriented project context: summary, tree, map, symbols, code search, PR
.PP
Each subcommand is one request to IronForge\*(Aqs AI aggregate endpoints, so an agent gets a repository\*(Aqs context in a single call. All are reads except `index`, which rebuilds the code search and symbol index. `\-\-json` prints the server\*(Aqs object unchanged; `\-\-template` renders the same object; without either, a compact Markdown\-style view is printed. Code search covers the default branch only.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ifg\-context\-repo(1)
Repository summary: default branch, description, counts, dates
.TP
ifg\-context\-tree(1)
List one page of the repository file tree
.TP
ifg\-context\-search(1)
Search file contents on the default branch
.TP
ifg\-context\-pr(1)
Pull request context: the PR and what it touches, in one object
.TP
ifg\-context\-map(1)
Ranked map of the repository\*(Aqs source files and their declarations
.TP
ifg\-context\-symbols(1)
Find where a symbol is defined, or list a file\*(Aqs declarations
.TP
ifg\-context\-index(1)
Rebuild the code search and symbol index of a commit
.TP
ifg\-context\-issues(1)
List issue summaries for AI use
.TP
ifg\-context\-prs(1)
List pull request summaries for AI use
.TP
ifg\-context\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.9.1
